          "text": "Bonke abantu bezwe bangena endlini kaBali, bayidiliza; ama-altare akhe nemifanekiso yakhe bakuphahlaza, bambulala uMathani, umpristi kaBali, phambi kwama-altare. Umpristi wayesebeka ababonisi phezu kwendlu kaJehova.",
