        {
          "text": "Wathatha izinduna zamakhulu, nezinduna, nabalindi, nabo bonke abantu bezwe; zayehlisa inkosi endlini kaJehova, zangena ngesango labalindi endlini yenkosi. Wahlala esihlalweni sobukhosi samakhosi.",
